{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看到了一只大熊喵？那是，在哪看到的？！」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4882", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我不能告诉你」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0437", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「快告诉我嘛。是在我们家附近看到的？」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4883", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「情报，你出多少钱买？」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0438", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昨天，我不是给你买了本动物图鉴吗」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4884", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我可没说过希望你买给我」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0439", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的，你这家伙性格可真不讨喜……\\n　你这样可交不到女朋友哦？」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": "「真是的，你这家伙性格可真不讨喜……　你这样可交不到女朋友哦？」", "plain_idx": 231, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4885", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不需要那种东西」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0440", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像是有点相互不和的姐弟之间的对话。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跑到活动室来玩的理央，带来了意想不到的消息。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「姆姆姆，出现了神秘的巨大的熊喵……」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3990", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说不定，那个巨大的熊喵，\\n　就是之前天羽学姐看到的那个……」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": "「说不定，那个巨大的熊喵，　就是之前天羽学姐看到的那个……」", "plain_idx": 243, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6611", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确实可能呢。\\n　我看到的那只好像也比小熊喵大……」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": "「确实可能呢。　我看到的那只好像也比小熊喵大……」", "plain_idx": 248, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3379", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那不是熊喵。\\n　是熊喵的进化种，其名为……」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": "「那不是熊喵。　是熊喵的进化种，其名为……」", "plain_idx": 251, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0441", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「其名为」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5385", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃乃」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0442", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「理央亲」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5386", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "通用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵二号熊喵二号」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃／理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 261, "voice": "_GO_050", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「懂了懂了，别突然异口同声喊出来」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6612", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理，吃醋了？」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5388", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谁、谁吃醋啊。我可不在意樱乃和谁的关系变亲密了……」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": "「谁、谁吃醋啊。我可不在意樱乃和谁的关系变亲密了……」", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6613", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵二号，熊喵二号。\\n　接下来不会要出现熊喵三号了吧？」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": "「熊喵二号，熊喵二号。　接下来不会要出现熊喵三号了吧？」", "plain_idx": 271, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3991", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，这个话题就到此为止」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4886", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然在某个地方，\\n　栖息着熊喵一族吧」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": "「果然在某个地方，　栖息着熊喵一族吧」", "plain_idx": 276, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「关于这事，你怎么看？」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5389", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜？」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0634", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原来如此」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5390", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你什么也没听懂吧，樱乃」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6614", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5391", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之，还需要更多的目击情报」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4887", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「然也。\\n　谜团重重的熊喵一族的秘密，\\n　现在，就要揭晓了！」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": "「然也。　谜团重重的熊喵一族的秘密，　现在，就要揭晓了！」", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3992", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「现在还什么都没弄清楚就是了」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6615", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只知道它的名字叫熊喵二号以及体型很大吗？」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5392", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还有，它跑得很快」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0444", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种事情，\\n果然不亲眼看看是没法形容的。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": "这种事情，果然不亲眼看看是没法形容的。", "plain_idx": 301, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比熊喵大，会是什么样子的啊。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……管它呢，理央。\\n　你也变得完全热衷于动物上了呢」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": "「……管它呢，理央。　你也变得完全热衷于动物上了呢」", "plain_idx": 304, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4888", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才没有」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0445", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「老骗人。昨天也是，\\n　明明看动物图鉴看到了好晚」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "「老骗人。昨天也是，　明明看动物图鉴看到了好晚」", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4889", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯哼哼。理央说不定将来会成为我们社的社团长吧？」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3380", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不可能。这种人要是成为社团长，\\n　其它社员肯定都会不服气而离开的」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": "「不可能。这种人要是成为社团长，　其它社员肯定都会不服气而离开的」", "plain_idx": 314, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4890", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没这回事吧，理央？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3381", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，没这回事」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0446", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理央和往常一样，一到美羽学姐面前就变会得特别耿直。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
